@startuml
title StockIV — Diagrama de clases del dominio

hide circle
hide empty methods
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam ArrowColor #1F4E79
skinparam ClassBorderColor #1F4E79
skinparam ClassBackgroundColor #F8FBFD
skinparam EnumBorderColor #6A1B9A
skinparam EnumBackgroundColor #F3E5F5

enum UserRole {
  ADMIN
  INVENTORY_CLERK
}

enum MovementType {
  ENTRY
  EXIT
  ADJUSTMENT_ENTRY
  ADJUSTMENT_EXIT
}

class User <<entity>> {
  +id: UUID
  +name: String
  +email: String
  -passwordHash: String
  +role: UserRole
  +active: Boolean
  +createdByUserId: UUID?
  +createdAt: DateTime
  +updatedAt: DateTime
}

class Product <<entity>> {
  +id: UUID
  +sku: String
  +name: String
  +description: String?
  +category: String
  +size: String?
  +color: String?
  +priceMxn: Decimal
  +active: Boolean
  +createdAt: DateTime
  +updatedAt: DateTime
}

class Branch <<entity>> {
  +id: UUID
  +code: String
  +name: String
  +active: Boolean
  +createdAt: DateTime
  +updatedAt: DateTime
}

class StockLevel <<entity>> {
  +productId: UUID
  +branchId: UUID
  +quantity: Integer
  +minimumThreshold: Integer
  +updatedAt: DateTime
  +isLowStock(): Boolean
}

class Movement <<immutable entity>> {
  +id: UUID
  +type: MovementType
  +quantity: Integer
  +reason: String
  +occurredAt: DateTime
  +productId: UUID
  +branchId: UUID
  +userId: UUID
  +transferId: UUID?
  +compensatesMovementId: UUID?
}

class Transfer <<aggregate root>> {
  +id: UUID
  +productId: UUID
  +sourceBranchId: UUID
  +destinationBranchId: UUID
  +quantity: Integer
  +reason: String
  +createdBy: UUID
  +occurredAt: DateTime
}

class Session <<entity>> {
  +id: UUID
  +jti: UUID
  +userId: UUID
  +issuedAt: DateTime
  +lastActivityAt: DateTime
  +expiresAt: DateTime
  +revokedAt: DateTime?
}

class LowStockAlert <<derived, read model>> {
  +productId: UUID
  +branchId: UUID
  +quantity: Integer
  +minimumThreshold: Integer
}

User ..> UserRole : usa
Movement ..> MovementType : usa
User "0..1 creador" <-- "0..* cuentas creadas" User : crea

Product "1" -- "0..*" StockLevel : mantiene >
Branch "1" -- "0..*" StockLevel : localiza >

User "1" <-- "0..*" Movement : registrado por
Product "1" <-- "0..*" Movement : afecta
Branch "1" <-- "0..*" Movement : ocurre en

User "1" <-- "0..*" Transfer : creada por
Product "1" <-- "0..*" Transfer : transfiere
Branch "1 origen" <-- "0..*" Transfer : sale de
Branch "1 destino" <-- "0..*" Transfer : entra a
Transfer "0..1" *-- "2" Movement : compone cuando es transferencia

Movement "0..1 original" <-- "0..* compensaciones" Movement : compensa
User "1" *-- "0..*" Session : posee
StockLevel ..> LowStockAlert : deriva si quantity <= minimumThreshold

note right of StockLevel
  Clave única compuesta:
  (productId, branchId)

  quantity >= 0
  minimumThreshold >= 0
end note

note right of Transfer
  sourceBranchId != destinationBranchId
  quantity > 0
  Se confirma o revierte con sus dos
  movimientos en una transacción ACID.
  Los movimientos deben ser:
  - un EXIT en la sucursal origen;
  - un ENTRY en la sucursal destino;
  - mismo producto y misma cantidad.
end note

note left of User
  createdByUserId es nulo únicamente para el
  administrador inicial creado por migración.
end note

note bottom of Movement
  No admite actualización ni eliminación.
  Una corrección crea otro movimiento y
  establece compensatesMovementId.
end note

note bottom of LowStockAlert
  No se persiste como fuente de verdad.
  Es una proyección de StockLevel.
end note
@enduml
